      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;c-and-python-techniques-for-detecting-rectangular-paper-shapes-in-images&#34;&gt;&amp;ldquo;C++ and Python Techniques for Detecting Rectangular Paper Shapes in Images&amp;rdquo;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;c-implementation-via-edge-detection-and-contour-analysis-solution-1&#34;&gt;C++ Implementation via Edge Detection and Contour Analysis (Solution 1)&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;One initial approach involves modifying existing OpenCV square detection demos written in C++. The core idea is to enhance edges through blurring and then iterate through color planes to find suitable contours that approximate a four-sided polygon.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The provided C++ function, &lt;code&gt;find_squares&lt;/code&gt;, preprocesses the image to improve edge detection:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
